Package: CustomerChurnSurvival
Title: Customer Churn Survival Analysis & LTV Estimation in R
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Renan", "Nocelli Britto", email = "renannocelli@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Statistical survival analysis pipeline for customer retention, time-to-churn modeling,
    Kaplan-Meier estimation, Log-Rank testing, Cox Proportional Hazards regression, residual LTV calculation,
    and interactive R Shiny simulation dashboard.
